{"id":"composer_000014","name":"古斯塔夫·马勒","originalName":"Gustav Mahler","aliases":["马勒","Gustav Mahler","Mahler"],"birthYear":1860,"deathYear":1911,"nationality":"奥地利","period":"浪漫主义","introduction":"奥地利晚期浪漫主义作曲家、指挥家，生于波希米亚。作为指挥家他长期执掌维也纳宫廷歌剧院与纽约大都会歌剧院；作为作曲家他写了十部规模宏大的交响曲与《大地之歌》，把交响曲扩展为容纳整个世界的形式。其音乐在民间歌调、自然音响与深沉哲思之间往来，深刻影响了二十世纪音乐。","styleSummary":"配器宏大细腻并存，交响曲常融入人声，情绪在纯真与讽刺、赞美与幻灭间大幅摆动。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-gustav-mahler","title":"Gustav Mahler","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_Mahler","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000038","composerId":"composer_000014","composerName":"古斯塔夫·马勒","title":"D大调第一交响曲「巨人」","originalTitle":"Symphonie Nr. 1 in D-Dur \"Titan\"","genre":"交响曲","periodKey":"romantic","genreFamily":"orchestral","durationMinutes":55,"difficulty":"需要专注","tags":["马勒","交响曲","浪漫主义","巨人","自然"],"summary":"马勒1888年完成的第一部交响曲，从林中晨号与杜鹃啼鸣出发，途经葬礼进行曲，最终抵达排山倒海的终曲，青春的澎湃一览无余。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_7085cde220c70441","perf_2ad59accad545c84"],"upcomingEventCount":2}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_7085cde220c70441","perf_2ad59accad545c84"],"upcomingEventCount":2}